o $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $6$ squares left and $3$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square up. Thus $OX=3|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-3\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $1$ square right and $1$ square up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square right and $1$ square up. Thus $XC=1|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-3\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-3$ and $\\mu=1$." 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761193 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761214 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761193 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761193 1077 "field-2" 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761193 1078 #edb/ref 17592186761214 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761193 1079 #uuid "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761194 1080 "-3" 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761194 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761194 1083 #uuid "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761195 1080 "-1" 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761195 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761195 1083 #uuid "4fab57f8-8f1d-5534-82ed-9551848475ed" 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761196 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761186 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761196 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761196 1077 "field-2" 13194139547582 17592186576411 true] [17592186761196 1078 #ed